    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif twegen gebroðra oððe twegen genyhe magas wið an wif forlicgan, beten swyþe georne, swa swa man geþafige, swa be wíte swa be lahslitte, be þam þe seo dæd sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If two brothers or two near relatives lie with one woman, they shall pay as compensation and with all promptness whatever sum shall be approved—whether as fine or lahslit—according to the gravity of the offence.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf twegen gebroðra oððon twegen genydmagas wið an wif forlicgan, beten swiðe georne, swa swa man geðafige, swa be wite swa be lahslite, be ðam ðe seo dæd sy.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
